"Ex. PW1/1(OSR) is copy of Aadhar Card of PW- 1;
Ex. PW1/2 (OSR) is copy of Aadhar Card of deceased;
Ex. PW1/3 (OSR) is copy of Aadhar Card of father of the deceased;
Ex. PW1/4 are DAR, MLC and postmortem; Ex. PW1/5 is chart of National Income (Colly) (Three pages)''.
MACT No. 345/22 Sunita & Ors.
